{"id": "85f8976d7088f46", "title": "四川省政府政务服务和公共资源交易服务中心关于修订《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》的通知", "sourceUrl": "https://ggzyjy.sc.gov.cn/xwzx/001003/20260126/93eefd01-bd9e-4309-b98a-d44ac27ed917.html", "date": "", "source": "四川公共资源交易中心", "content": "四川省政府政务服务和公共资源交易服务中心关于修订《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》的通知\n发布时间：2026-01-26 16:00:17    来源：四川省公共资源交易信息网    浏览次数：\n原文链接\n各市（州）公共资源交易服务中心，省中心各处室、直属单位，各有关单位：\n为进一步规范省级公共资源进场交易场地预约行为，根据《四川省公共资源交易目录》《四川省公共资源交易平台管理实施细则》《四川省人民政府办公厅关于深化改革创新促进招标投标市场规范健康发展的意见》，我们研究修订了《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》，现印发你们，请认真贯彻执行。\n附件：《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》\n（此页无正文）\n四川省政府政务服务和公共资源交易服务中心\n2026年1月26日\n附件：\n《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》.docx", "html": "<html><body><div class=\"container news-detailed\">\n<h2 class=\"detailed-title\" id=\"title\">四川省政府政务服务和公共资源交易服务中心关于修订《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》的通知</h2>\n<p class=\"detailed-desc\">发布时间：2026-01-26 16:00:17    来源：四川省公共资源交易信息网    浏览次数：    <a data-value=\"\" href=\"javaScript:void(0)\" id=\"originurl_a\">原文链接</a></p>\n<div class=\"clearfix\" id=\"newsText\"><div class=\"Section0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid: both loose 15.6pt none;\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 34pt; margin-left: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\">各市（州）公共资源交易服务中心，省中心各处室、直属单位，各有关单位：<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 29pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">为进一步规范省级公共资源进场交易场地预约行为，根据《四川省公共资源交易目录》《四川省公共资源交易平台管理实施细则》《四川省人民政府办公厅关于深化改革创新促进招标投标市场规范健康发展的意见》，我们研究修订了《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》，现印发你们，请认真贯彻执行。<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\"> <o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">附件：《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"> <o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">      <o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">（此页无正文）<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\"><o:p> </o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">  <o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">                  四川省政府政务服务和公共资源交易服务中心<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p align=\"justify\" class=\"p\" style=\"margin: 0pt; padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 31pt; text-indent: 32pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; -ms-text-justify: inter-ideograph; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\">                                  2026年1月26日<o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n<br clear=\"all\" style=\"page-break-before: always; mso-break-type: section-break;\"/>\n\n<div class=\"Section1\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid: both loose 15.6pt none;\">\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 31pt; -ms-text-autospace: ideograph-numeric; mso-pagination: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-left: 0.0000gd;\"><o:p><br/>\n</o:p></p>\n</div><div class=\"attach_content\">附件： <a class=\"attachUrl\" href=\"/uploadfile/93eefd01-bd9e-4309-b98a-d44ac27ed917/%E3%80%8A%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E7%9C%81%E7%9C%81%E7%BA%A7%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E8%BF%9B%E5%9C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E5%9C%BA%E5%9C%B0%E9%A2%84%E7%BA%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E8%A7%84%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%8B.docx\" title=\"《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》.docx\">《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》.docx</a> </div><input id=\"souceinfoid\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"93eefd01-bd9e-4309-b98a-d44ac27ed917\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>", "method": "", "region": "四川", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"name": "《四川省省级公共资源进场交易场地预约工作规程》.docx", "original_url": "https://ggzyjy.sc.gov.cn/uploadfile/93eefd01-bd9e-4309-b98a-d44ac27ed917/%E3%80%8A%E5%9B%9B%E5%B7%9D%E7%9C%81%E7%9C%81%E7%BA%A7%E5%85%AC%E5%85%B1%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%E8%BF%9B%E5%9C%BA%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E5%9C%BA%E5%9C%B0%E9%A2%84%E7%BA%A6%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E8%A7%84%E7%A8%8B%E3%80%8B.docx", "error": "Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)"}], "hasAttachment": true, "is_bid